      "relation": "family"
    }
  ],
  "level_notes": {
    "1": "No formal spec; Apple's Property List Programming Guide and the PropertyList-1.0 DTD define the XML form. The binary format is documented only in comments of CFBinaryPList.c.",
    "0": "CoreFoundation's CFBinaryPList.c (open source) is the de facto reference for bplist00."
  },
